<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">23082026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>In a half-finished building in Warri, in Nigeria's Delta State, a self-described web developer named David Erubure is documented as having built hundreds of fake investment websites that took the savings of Norwegian retirees.</s> <s>Transnational fraud is now assembled from parts bought where each part is cheapest — the persuasive persona built near the victims, the payment rails routed where regulation is thinnest, and the code written in Nigeria for a fraction of a Norwegian wage.</s> <s>He's both the least paid link in that chain and the most legally exposed, because he's the only one sitting in a country the money never reached.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A judge in Preston has ruled that five Palestine activists who caused two hundred and twelve thousand pounds of damage at a Barclays branch won't be sentenced as terrorists.</s> <s>What the ruling concedes by existing is more striking than the ruling itself — prosecutors asked a British court to treat broken windows as terrorism, and under Britain's Terrorism Act of two thousand, serious property damage intended to influence government policy already meets the statutory test on its face.</s> <s>The only thing standing between a protester and a terrorism conviction, then, is prosecutorial discretion and one judge's reading of seriousness — and the next case starts from the same statute.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Families of journalists killed by Israeli strikes gathered at Lebanon's National Theatre and asked not for a Lebanese court, but for the International Criminal Court.</s> <s>Their choice of forum is the whole story, and it rests on a hard fact — neither Lebanon nor Israel has joined the Rome Statute, so the court they're petitioning holds no automatic jurisdiction over their case at all.</s> <s>The court's reach is built from ratifications and referrals, never from the gravity of a crime... which is why a killing can sit squarely inside its subject matter and entirely outside its map.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A drone struck a car in Beit Jinn, in the countryside southwest of Damascus, and Syria's government took its complaint to the UN Security Council rather than to the battlefield.</s> <s>Beit Jinn sits against the Golan, inside the belt Israeli forces have treated as a security zone since Assad fell in December of two thousand twenty-four, and each strike there redraws the nineteen seventy-four disengagement line by simple fact.</s> <s>Villagers along that line have no air defence and no state able to protest on their behalf effectively.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>India's governing party has launched a nationwide campaign demanding that all six verses of Vande Mataram be sung, not the two that Congress restricts itself to.</s> <s>The verses after the opening two personify the nation as the goddess Durga, which is exactly why Muslim members of the Congress asked in nineteen thirty-seven that only the first stanzas be used — and why the Constituent Assembly later made Jana Gana Mana the anthem and left this text the lesser status of national song.</s> <s>What's being demanded now isn't a new symbol but the reversal of a compromise deliberately built to be sayable by everyone.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>An Australian One Nation member of parliament, David Farley, has conceded that his party's migration target isn't too different from Labor's once you add the hundred thousand farm and care workers it wants counted separately from its headline figure of a hundred and thirty thousand.</s> <s>Migration politics almost everywhere runs on that gap between the headline and the composition beneath it — work that citizens won't do at the offered wage still has to be filled, so restrictionist programmes carve out a visa class and call it something other than migration.</s> <s>The objection was never really to the number; it's to permanence, and to who eventually becomes a citizen.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Satellite imagery from the Dalian yard shows the hull of China's fourth aircraft carrier, the Type oh oh four, taking shape — and analysts believe, though Beijing hasn't confirmed it, that the ship is nuclear-powered.</s> <s>That distinction decides everything, because a conventional carrier is chained to oilers and to friendly ports, which is why every distant-water navy in history has needed a chain of coaling stations from Djibouti to Gwadar.</s> <s>Nuclear propulsion removes the ship's own fuel from that chain but not its escorts' — buying reach without buying independence, across a radius that reaches the Arabian Sea and the Gulf.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nigerian press groups are demanding an independent investigation after officers flogged the editor Sunday Ogwu with a cable at a demolition site in Abuja's Lugbe district, seizing his phone after he identified himself as a journalist.</s> <s>The coalition wants the inquiry run outside the command it says ordered the beating, for an obvious reason — Ogwu is currently scheduled to give his statement to that very same command.</s> <s>An investigation that reports to the accused isn't an investigation, and everyone involved knows it.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Pakistan Customs collected a record fifteen billion rupees in duty on Chinese goods crossing the Khunjerab Pass, while goods worth two point eight billion travelled the other way.</s> <s>Lead with that ratio rather than the record — more than five rupees collected on imports for every rupee of outbound trade, at the crossing meant to be the northern artery of the China-Pakistan Economic Corridor.</s> <s>A corridor isn't a trade relationship... it's a direction, and infrastructure can only move what a country actually has to sell.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Tata Motors is raising prices by up to twenty-five thousand rupees from the first of September, and the detail worth holding is that the rise covers its electric cars too.</s> <s>Every story told about electric vehicles says battery packs get cheaper each year, so a price rise is a claim that something else moved harder — rare-earth magnets for traction motors, power electronics, imported drivetrain parts, all sitting downstream of Chinese export controls and Indian duty.</s> <s>Cheaper batteries and cheaper electric cars have quietly stopped being the same sentence, and it's the buyer financing at the margin who finds that out.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Canada has rejected American relief on heavy trucks, leaving fifty percent tariffs standing on twenty billion dollars of Canadian exports.</s> <s>Ottawa retaliates dollar for dollar rather than proportionally, and picks its targets — steel, dairy, electronics — for political pain in specific American constituencies rather than for economic symmetry.</s> <s>That's a strategy built on the assumption that a trading partner's legislature is more responsive than its executive.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Russia's deputy prime minister Alexander Novak says the country will import fuel and lower its own quality standards, after Ukrainian drones set a warehouse ablaze at Chapayevsk in Samara.</s> <s>Crude oil is fungible but refining isn't, so striking a refinery strands a country's own oil rather than cutting what it sells abroad — which is why Russian exports continue while Russian drivers queue.</s> <s>Octane and sulphur grades depend on specific refinery units, and Novak wouldn't say when the lower grades take effect.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Tehran has vowed to target its neighbours' oil routes, and Brent crude is trading near ninety-five dollars.</s> <s>Every such threat raises the value of the infrastructure built to make the Strait of Hormuz optional — France and Saudi Arabia meet Sunday on bypass pipelines and rail, and Egypt is trying to revive its own line.</s> <s>A chokepoint threatened often enough eventually finances the thing that routes around it, permanently.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Congo's Ebola outbreak is now growing exponentially, and that word means something operationally rather than emotionally.</s> <s>Ebola is controlled by contact tracing and ring vaccination, not by treatment, so every traced chain is a chain that stops — which makes exponential growth the precise signature of transmission nobody is watching.</s> <s>The trajectory measures the surveillance system, not the virus, and that's why the same pathogen produces thirty cases in one country and thousands in another.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Nairobi, a bakery's shelves are filling with cassava and sorghum flour, funded by gluten-free demand in Europe and North America.</s> <s>These grains weren't displaced because they yield less — wheat, maize and rice absorbed the breeding money and extension services for seventy years, so the yield gap is an artefact of where research went, and fonio ripens in six to eight weeks on land wheat can't use.</s> <s>The hazard travelled ahead of them: when quinoa found an export price, Andean households sold the harvest and bought cheaper imported starch, moving income one way and nutrition the other.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers studying Qurayyah Painted Ware, made in what's now Saudi Arabia's Tabuk region, argue it met all eight criteria that define a modern brand — some three thousand two hundred years before the concept had a name.</s> <s>A fixed design, a steady clay recipe and centralised production let a buyer hundreds of miles away trust a workshop they'd never see, which is the entire function branding still performs.</s> <s>Trust at distance, it turns out, is an old technology that we mistake for a recent one.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Researchers in Ankara put three chatbots through a hundred and seventy-nine questions from Turkey's national dental specialty exam in April, then again in July — and two of them scored differently the second time.</s> <s>A hosted model is a moving target, because providers retrain, quantise and swap system prompts behind an unchanged name, so a hospital that validated a tool at seventy-eight percent has validated a version that may no longer exist.</s> <s>There's no version pin and no changelog, which is the regulatory gap in clinical AI that every benchmark published as a single number hides.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The US Navy has acknowledged an extreme-range air-to-air missile called Malice, and at those distances the targets aren't fighters — they're the tankers, the radar planes and the jammers a strike package can't function without.</s> <s>Long-range air combat is a sensing problem rather than a propulsion one, since something has to keep seeing the target for the minutes the missile takes to arrive, through a datalink chain of satellites, aircraft and ships that a jammer can break.</s> <s>The missile's real range is the range of the network guiding it — and an air force can lose superiority having lost no fighters at all.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>France's space agency has asked industry for telescope designs manufacturable in runs of more than a thousand units, trading resolution for how often a satellite passes overhead.</s> <s>Mass-produced optics would let smaller states field their own imaging constellations rather than buying pictures from those who already have them, which changes who gets to verify a claim about their own territory.</s> <s>Whether the manufacturing base materialises at that price is still an open question, God willing answered by the demonstrations expected next.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>